cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scamdb data in research or a product, please credit it as: scamdb.dev · CC BY 4.0"
type: dataset
title: "scamdb: an open database of scam patterns"
abstract: >-
  Scam patterns from 76 countries, each built from real, documented scams with dated sources: how the scam works,
  its script step by step, real messages in their original language, warning signs, what to do and who to report it to.
authors:
  - name: "scamdb contributors"
url: "https://scamdb.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nahuelsantos/scamdb"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - scams
  - fraud
  - phishing
  - smishing
  - open data
  - scam detection
